an-meats","verses":"1-2"},{"kind":"encyclopedia","label":"Sacrifice and Atonement","url":"/encyclopedia/sacrifice-and-atonement","verses":"1-2"},{"kind":"case","label":"Jephthah's vow","url":"/cases/06-judges/jephthah","verses":"2"},{"kind":"case","label":"Hiel the Bethelite","url":"/cases/08-divided-kingdom/hiel-the-bethelite","verses":"2"},{"kind":"law","label":"4D.5 If a man makes a vow to God or swears an oath to bind himself by contract or binding obligation, he shall not violate his word but shall do all that he stated.","url":"/law/04-law-and-justice/4d#4D.5","verses":"2"},{"kind":"law","label":"4D.9 If a young woman, who is under her father's house, makes a vow and her father hears it but says nothing then all her vows shall stand.","url":"/law/04-law-and-justice/4d#4D.9","verses":"3-4"},{"kind":"law","label":"4D.10 A father can cancel the obligations of a vow or contract by his daughter who is in his house.","url":"/law/04-law-and-justice/4d#4D.10","verses":"5"},{"kind":"law","label":"4D.11 A husband can allow or annul the vows or contracts made by his wife.","url":"/law/04-law-and-justice/4d#4D.11","verses":"6-8"},{"kind":"law","label":"4D.12 A vow of a widow or divorced woman shall stand against her.","url":"/law/04-law-and-justice/4d#4D.12","verses":"9"},{"kind":"law","label":"4D.13 If a divorced woman makes a vow while in her husband's house, her husband can affirm or annul the vow.","url":"/law/04-law-and-justice/4d#4D.13","verses":"10-14"}]}